{"seq":3,"slug":"redis-streams-nats","title":"Redis Streams 与 NATS 消息系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/redis-streams-nats","wordCount":612,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"redis-streams-与-nats-消息系统\">Redis Streams 与 NATS 消息系统</h1><p>并非所有场景都需要 Kafka 的复杂性或 RabbitMQ 的重量级部署。<strong>Redis Streams</strong> 是 Redis 5.0 引入的原生消息流数据结构，适合已有 Redis 基础设施的团队以低成本获得持久化消息能力。<strong>NATS</strong> 是一个轻量级、高性能的云原生消息系统，以极低的延迟和简单的运维著称。两者各有定位，是大型消息中间件的有力补充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"redis-streams-核心概念\">Redis Streams 核心概念</h2><p>Redis Streams 是一个仅追加的日志数据结构，支持消费者组、消息 ACK 和 PEL（Pending Entry List）机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P[XADD orders] --&gt; S[(Stream: orders)]&#10;    S --&gt; CG1[消费者组: payment-service\\nCG offset]&#10;    S --&gt; CG2[消费者组: notification-service\\nCG offset]&#10;    CG1 --&gt; C1[Consumer 1\\nPEL: 未 ACK 消息]&#10;    CG1 --&gt; C2[Consumer 2\\nPEL: 未 ACK 消息]\">flowchart LR\n    P[XADD orders] --&gt; S[(Stream: orders)]\n    S --&gt; CG1[消费者组: payment-service\\nCG offset]\n    S --&gt; CG2[消费者组: notification-service\\nCG offset]\n    CG1 --&gt; C1[Consumer 1\\nPEL: 未 ACK 消息]\n    CG1 --&gt; C2[Consumer 2\\nPEL: 未 ACK 消息]</pre><p><strong>基本操作</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生产消息&#10;XADD orders * type order_placed user_id 42 amount 99.99&#10;# 返回消息 ID：1720000000000-0（时间戳-序号）&#10;&#10;# 创建消费者组（从最新消息开始消费）&#10;XGROUP CREATE orders payment-service $ MKSTREAM&#10;&#10;# 消费消息（最多 10 条，阻塞等待 2s）&#10;XREADGROUP GROUP payment-service consumer-1 COUNT 10 BLOCK 2000 STREAMS orders &gt;&#10;&#10;# 确认消息&#10;XACK orders payment-service 1720000000000-0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生产消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XADD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> order_placed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user_id</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> amount</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 99.99</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 返回消息 ID：1720000000000-0（时间戳-序号）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 创建消费者组（从最新消息开始消费）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XGROUP</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">MKSTREAM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 消费消息（最多 10 条，阻塞等待 2s）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XREADGROUP</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> consumer-1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> BLOCK</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2000</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> STREAMS</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 确认消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XACK</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> payment-service</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 1720000000000-0</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Go 代码示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 生产&#10;func publishOrder(rdb *redis.Client, order Order) error {&#10;    _, err := rdb.XAdd(context.Background(), &amp;redis.XAddArgs{&#10;        Stream: &quot;orders&quot;,&#10;        Values: map[string]interface{}{&#10;            &quot;type&quot;:    &quot;order_placed&quot;,&#10;            &quot;user_id&quot;: order.UserID,&#10;            &quot;amount&quot;:  order.Amount,&#10;        },&#10;    }).Result()&#10;    return err&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 消费（带 ACK）&#10;func consume(rdb *redis.Client) {&#10;    for {&#10;        results, err := rdb.XReadGroup(context.Background(), &amp;redis.XReadGroupArgs{&#10;            Group:    &quot;payment-service&quot;,&#10;            Consumer: &quot;consumer-1&quot;,&#10;            Streams:  []string{&quot;orders&quot;, &quot;&gt;&quot;},&#10;            Count:    10,&#10;            Block:    2 * time.Second,&#10;        }).Result()&#10;        if err != nil {&#10;            continue&#10;        }&#10;        for _, stream := range results {&#10;            for _, msg := range stream.Messages {&#10;                if err := processMsg(msg); err == nil {&#10;                    rdb.XAck(context.Background(), &quot;orders&quot;, &quot;payment-service&quot;, msg.ID)&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 生产</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> publishOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rdb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    _, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rdb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XAdd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XAddArgs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Stream: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Values: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:    </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_placed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: order.UserID,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  order.Amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费（带 ACK）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> consume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rdb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rdb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XReadGroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XReadGroupArgs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Group:    </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Consumer: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"consumer-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Streams:  []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Count:    </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Block:    </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, stream </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stream.Messages {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processMsg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    rdb.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XAck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, msg.ID)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"redis-streams-消息积压与修剪\">Redis Streams 消息积压与修剪</h2><p>Streams 持续增长需要配置修剪策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 保留最新 10000 条消息（近似修剪，MAXLEN ~ 高效）&#10;XADD orders MAXLEN ~ 10000 * type order_placed ...&#10;&#10;# 或者按时间戳修剪（删除 7 天前的消息）&#10;XTRIM orders MINID ~ (CURRENT_TIMESTAMP - 7days)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 保留最新 10000 条消息（近似修剪，MAXLEN ~ 高效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XADD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> MAXLEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> order_placed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或者按时间戳修剪（删除 7 天前的消息）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">XTRIM</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> orders</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> MINID</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (CURRENT_TIMESTAMP </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 7days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Stream 特性</th>\n<th>值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单条消息大小</td>\n<td>建议 &lt; 1MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大吞吐</td>\n<td>~100K msg/s（单节点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久化</td>\n<td>RDB + AOF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集群支持</td>\n<td>Redis Cluster（按 key hash）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者组</td>\n<td>支持（类 Kafka 语义）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"nats-消息系统\">NATS 消息系统</h2><p>NATS 以主题（Subject）为基本路由单元，支持通配符匹配，核心特点是<strong>发布后即忘（Fire-and-Forget）</strong> 的极低延迟。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P1[Publisher\\n发布到 orders.created] --&gt; NS[NATS Server]&#10;    NS --&gt;|精确订阅| S1[Subscriber: orders.created]&#10;    NS --&gt;|通配符 orders.*| S2[Subscriber: orders.*]&#10;    NS --&gt;|通配符 orders.&gt;| S3[Subscriber: orders.&gt;]\">flowchart LR\n    P1[Publisher\\n发布到 orders.created] --&gt; NS[NATS Server]\n    NS --&gt;|精确订阅| S1[Subscriber: orders.created]\n    NS --&gt;|通配符 orders.*| S2[Subscriber: orders.*]\n    NS --&gt;|通配符 orders.&gt;| S3[Subscriber: orders.&gt;]</pre><p><strong>Subject 通配符规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>orders.*</code> — 匹配 <code>orders.created</code>、<code>orders.cancelled</code>（单层）</li>\n<li><code>orders.&gt;</code> — 匹配 <code>orders.created</code>、<code>orders.items.added</code>（多层）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Go 示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"nc, _ := nats.Connect(nats.DefaultURL)&#10;defer nc.Close()&#10;&#10;// 发布&#10;nc.Publish(&quot;orders.created&quot;, []byte(`{&quot;user_id&quot;: 42, &quot;amount&quot;: 99.99}`))&#10;&#10;// 订阅&#10;nc.Subscribe(&quot;orders.*&quot;, func(m *nats.Msg) {&#10;    log.Printf(&quot;收到消息: subject=%s body=%s&quot;, m.Subject, m.Data)&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 请求-响应模式（同步 RPC）&#10;msg, err := nc.Request(&quot;user.lookup&quot;, []byte(&quot;42&quot;), 2*time.Second)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nc, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nats.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Connect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nats.DefaultURL)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`{\"user_id\": 42, \"amount\": 99.99}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Msg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"收到消息: subject=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> body=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, m.Subject, m.Data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 请求-响应模式（同步 RPC）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msg, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user.lookup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"42\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Second)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"nats-jetstream-持久化扩展\">NATS JetStream：持久化扩展</h2><p>NATS 核心是 At-Most-Once，<strong>JetStream</strong> 为其添加持久化、消费者组和 At-Least-Once 语义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"js, _ := nc.JetStream()&#10;&#10;// 创建 Stream（持久化存储）&#10;js.AddStream(&amp;nats.StreamConfig{&#10;    Name:       &quot;ORDERS&quot;,&#10;    Subjects:   []string{&quot;orders.*&quot;},&#10;    MaxAge:     7 * 24 * time.Hour,&#10;    Storage:    nats.FileStorage,&#10;    Replicas:   3,&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 创建持久化消费者&#10;js.AddConsumer(&quot;ORDERS&quot;, &amp;nats.ConsumerConfig{&#10;    Durable:       &quot;payment-processor&quot;,&#10;    AckPolicy:     nats.AckExplicitPolicy,&#10;    MaxDeliver:    3,&#10;    FilterSubject: &quot;orders.created&quot;,&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 消费（手动 ACK）&#10;sub, _ := js.PullSubscribe(&quot;orders.created&quot;, &quot;payment-processor&quot;)&#10;msgs, _ := sub.Fetch(10, nats.MaxWait(2*time.Second))&#10;for _, msg := range msgs {&#10;    process(msg)&#10;    msg.Ack()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">js, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">JetStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 创建 Stream（持久化存储）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">js.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AddStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StreamConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Name:       </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ORDERS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Subjects:   []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MaxAge:     </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 24</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Hour,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Storage:    nats.FileStorage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Replicas:   </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 创建持久化消费者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">js.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AddConsumer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ORDERS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ConsumerConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Durable:       </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-processor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    AckPolicy:     nats.AckExplicitPolicy,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MaxDeliver:    </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    FilterSubject: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消费（手动 ACK）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sub, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> js.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PullSubscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-processor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msgs, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sub.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, nats.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MaxWait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Second))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msgs {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    msg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Ack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"三系统横向对比\">三系统横向对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Redis Streams</th>\n<th>NATS Core</th>\n<th>NATS JetStream</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持久化</td>\n<td>是（RDB/AOF）</td>\n<td>否（内存）</td>\n<td>是（文件/内存）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投递语义</td>\n<td>At-Least-Once</td>\n<td>At-Most-Once</td>\n<td>At-Least-Once</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费者组</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持（Durable Consumer）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大吞吐</td>\n<td>~100K/s</td>\n<td>~10M/s</td>\n<td>~1M/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>&lt; 1ms</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.1ms</td>\n<td>&lt; 1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集群</td>\n<td>Redis Cluster</td>\n<td>NATS Cluster</td>\n<td>NATS JetStream Cluster</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最佳场景</td>\n<td>已有 Redis 栈</td>\n<td>服务发现/事件通知</td>\n<td>云原生事件流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"选型建议\">选型建议</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>选 Redis Streams</strong>：团队已用 Redis，消息量中等（&lt; 100K/s），希望低运维成本</li>\n<li><strong>选 NATS Core</strong>：需要极低延迟的服务间通知/RPC，不需要消息持久化</li>\n<li><strong>选 NATS JetStream</strong>：云原生微服务架构，需要持久化但不想引入 Kafka 的复杂性</li>\n<li><strong>选 Kafka</strong>：高吞吐事件流（&gt; 1M/s），需要长期消息保留和回放能力（见<a href=\"kafka-in-depth\">Kafka 深度实践</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Redis Streams 是低成本获得消息队列能力的最佳路径，适合已有 Redis 基础设施的中小型系统。NATS 在延迟和吞吐方面表现卓越，JetStream 扩展了其持久化能力。选型时，不必追求最强的系统，而是选择与现有技术栈匹配、运维成本可控的方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Redis Streams 与 NATS 消息系统","id":"redis-streams-与-nats-消息系统"},{"level":2,"text":"Redis Streams 核心概念","id":"redis-streams-核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Redis Streams 消息积压与修剪","id":"redis-streams-消息积压与修剪"},{"level":2,"text":"NATS 消息系统","id":"nats-消息系统"},{"level":2,"text":"NATS JetStream：持久化扩展","id":"nats-jetstream-持久化扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"三系统横向对比","id":"三系统横向对比"},{"level":2,"text":"选型建议","id":"选型建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RabbitMQ 模式与高可用配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/rabbitmq-patterns"},"next":{"title":"背压与流量控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/engineering/backpressure-flow-control"}}